    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Users submit training jobs with multi-dimensional parallelism to a DL job scheduler [ 38 , 69 ], which allocates it to GPUs.</hasEvidenceText>
