    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gradients are computed during the backward computation and used in the model update stage.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The gradients w.r.t. ( ) are computed and applied immediately on the GPU every iteration</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">as gradients are computed for each layer, a reduce-scatter operation is immediately initiated to aggregate them.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">gradient swap-out from GPU to CPU</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">each layers gradients are offloaded and updated sequentially during the backward pass</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
