    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">replicate the entire model state across all GPUs, which leads to substantial redundant memory usage.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">resulting in networking bottlenecks when the batch size is insufficient to hide communication latencies</hasEvidenceText>
