    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data sharding. Data parallelism (DP) [ 25 , 50 ] shards the input data along the batch dimension, enabling different model replicas to process data simultaneously</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data parallelism (DP) [ 25 , 50 ] shards the input data along the batch dimension, enabling different model replicas to process data simultaneously</hasEvidenceText>
