    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">isolate the impact of system scale on training efficiency</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">large-batch training improves training efficiency in terms of memory utilization</hasEvidenceText>
