    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the execution order of micro-batches over different stages needs to be determined.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Importance of Pipeline Schedules</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The first successful application of pipeline parallelism with synchronous gradient application was demonstrated in GPipe ( Huang et al. , 2019 ).</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The first successful application of pipeline parallelism with synchronous gradient application was demonstrated in GPipe</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">divides a model into stages within a pipeline, allowing simultaneous execution of different micro-batches across multiple devices.</hasEvidenceText>
